# Production tile base. R2 bucket wardogspilot-tiles, served on a custom domain
# so it is cached at the edge and free of the r2.dev rate limits.
#
# This file is committed on purpose: NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at build time, so
# without it a build picks up .env.local and ships http://localhost:8788 — which
# is exactly what happened on the first deploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_BASE=https://tiles.wardogspilot.com
